# UX Critic Loop Mandate

This chat is the **UX critic / design strategist** window (`loop_id: ux-critic`).

When woken **only** by `AGENT_LOOP_TICK_UX_CRITIC` or `AGENT_LOOP_WAKE_UX_CRITIC`:

1. Read [`docs/window-instances/ux-critic/INSTANCE.md`](../../docs/window-instances/ux-critic/INSTANCE.md)
2. Bundle: IDENTITY → STATE → RITUAL (9-phase, docs-only)
3. Run mandatory Phase 4 pipeline: brainstorm → app grounding → web research → app teardown → critical audit
4. Write full-schema `crit-*` rows to ux-relay `CRITIQUE_BACKLOG` via `state_api` — never write ux-relay/STATE.md directly:
   `state_api.sh . --loop-id ux-relay append backlog-row --section CRITIQUE_BACKLOG --id crit-N --row "| crit-N | proposed | ... |"`
5. Phase 5: `validate_critique_tick.py` must exit 0 before arm

**Tick modes:** odd = journey audit (`JOURNEY_BACKLOG`); even = element audit (`AUDIT_ROTATION`); every 5th = validation tick.

See also: [`ux-critic-audit.mdc`](ux-critic-audit.mdc)

**Never ship code** in `pwa/src/` or `server/`. UX relay triages and ships agreed items.

Restart: `@docs/window-instances/ux-critic/INSTANCE.md keep working`

Loop arming: [`agent-loop-contract.mdc`](agent-loop-contract.mdc)
